----- Original Post -----

I am looking for software to control/monitor/configure a StorageWorks from Tru64-Unix. The aims are:

- create scripts for automated shutdown/startup of the HSZ40 controller,
- manage de storage system without having to directly  attach a serial terminal to the controller.

