Thanks to Dr. Blinn who pointed in the right direction.

What's in the bookshelf files is mixed case.  Bookreader converts
the case before printing the message.

What's required is:

   /usr/share/doclib/ODL/U99Q1_1 

in place of:

   /usr/share/doclib/odl/u99q1_1

Simple fix is to change the case on the two intermediate level directories.


