I wrote:

> I know this is probably a stupid question, but will DU 4.0D automatically
> change the clock this weekend?

The answer is yes it will change automatically.  thanks to Tom Blinn for the
confirmation.  /etc/zoneinfo/localtime should be a link to the appropriate
timezone.  There are also  "rule" files in /etc/zoneinfo/sources that
contain the day that the system will set the clock ahead and behind.  thanks
again 

